xt","text":"So in Brasileirao_Matches.csv, 2019, there's only \"Atletico\" (the state was stripped). Let me check the raw data — is it \"Atletico-MG\" and \"Atletico-PR\" and \"Atletico-GO\"? Let me check the raw home_team values.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecc07678001PtkF5EcqjCYZjH","sessionID":"ses_1135b5c4dffe1dMwyYjBsXJ2H8","messageID":"msg_eecc059f7001WlBds0BViUqC64"}}
